<title>USA: Parexel sets 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Parexel sets 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Parexel International Corp said Tuesday it has set a two-for-one stock split, which will be payable in the form of a stock dividend.</p>
<p>Stockholders of record as of the close of business on February 7 will receive one additional share of stock for each share owned.</p>
<p>The distribution of shares is expected to occur on or about February 21, the company said.</p>
</text>
